HYP-3476 DEAD-COVER PAIR-CURRENT EXCEPTION AUDIT
status=EVIDENCE / two-gate graph-current audit; not an LRC14 proof
source=HYP-3472 dead-cover projection + HYP-3475 mirror-orbit rule

## Assumption Challenge
alternate vertices considered: runners, gaps, fixed circle sections,
section boundaries, wall-crossing events, residues, cover arcs, Fourier
modes, matroid circuits, survivor gates, mirror orbits, gate pairs,
blocker labels, graph cuts, and formal proof obligations.
chosen carrier vertices: low-rank E/branch gate pairs and pair-current
cut obligations in the dead-cover blocker projection.
preserved predicate: target row has a <=2-gate boundary-current carrier
after deleting adjacent blocker labels.
destroyed if scalarized: interval geometry, ordered branch orientation,
and typed endpoint sidecars; HYP-3474 warns against count/color shadows.

