## Lemma Target
Finite audited form:
  HYP-3472's single-gate exception set can be replaced by the rows that
  still lack a two-gate projection cut or separating current above.
  If the remaining set is empty, HYP-3473 can expose a <=2-gate terminal
  boundary-current packet.  If not, the remaining rows are the sharper
  finite debt for HYP-3455/HYP-3451/HYP-3460/two-adic/SPEC routes.

